= Style of learning

= My background

I don't hold high regard for my abilities to do anything in general, probably because I am hyperaware of my limitations. I (as the person before I finish this self study tour) am certainly not well trained in any of the topics, that is the reason why I want to do this in the first place. That said, I do have years of research experiences, and I have some exposure to the topics I am studying. So in the end, this series of notes may not be suitable for absolute beginners, as they assume some level of mathematical maturity.

Another thing worth mentioning is that I am a physicist by training, meaning comparing to a pure mathematician, I may approach problems from a different angle, often more intuitive and less rigorous. 